              "desc": "· Agent CRIT DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color>.\n· ATK of Agents with Attack specialty <color=#2BAD00>increases by 10%</color>. Their Basic Attack DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color> and ignore <color=#2BAD00>15%</color> of enemy DEF."
