            "69013301": {
              "title": "Metamorph",
              "desc": "· When an Agent inflicts an Attribute Anomaly on an enemy, the enemy recovers from Stun <color=#2BAD00>15% slower</color>, and the whole squad's ATK <color=#2BAD00>increases by 15%</color> for 20s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.\n· When an enemy is Stunned, the whole squad recovers <color=#2BAD00>20 Energy</color>, and Abloom DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color> for 30s. Repeated triggers reset the duration. The Energy Generation effect can trigger once every 30s."
            },
